


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_a7b69964:



    voice "2RI_0633"
    rin "「经济真是处处相关啊。全日本的女生都在买巧克力，不觉得会大幅带动经济发展吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_9d241189:


    "以文的座位为中心，情人节的预热氛围在空气中飘散开来。伦在旁注视着一切，表情不知是叹服还是无奈。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_9a496f39:



    voice "2RI_0634"
    rin "「好想征收情人节税来分一杯甜羹啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_bc46c7ba:


    "甜羹……？"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_8ee108b4:



    voice "2HI_0624"
    hina "「伦哪来的权利征税啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_f31bb1a5:



    voice "2RI_0635"
    rin "「啊，阳菜绝对会收到巧克力吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_6feb5ff9:



    voice "2HI_0625"
    hina "「唔，总感觉你这问法不怀好意」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_840bf55f:



    voice "2RI_0636"
    rin "「是你想太多了。所以，回答如何？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_dab024c6:



    voice "2HI_0626"
    hina "「嘛、嘛……没说错」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_14d0b630:



    voice "2RI_0637"
    rin "「果然」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_11105fda:



    voice "2MI_0528"
    miyako "「真有人气啊～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_f35d270d:



    voice "2HI_0627"
    hina "「不如说是因为大家没把我当女生对待吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_ddac71a9:



    voice "2RI_0638"
    rin "「一直被当做小不点？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_7274342b:



    voice "2HI_0628"
    hina "「小学的时候还是长高了的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_3a52c225:



    voice "2RI_0639"
    rin "「那就是中学以后一直被当做小不点？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_e0104966:



    voice "2HI_0629"
    hina "「从来没有被当做小不点！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_d3818464:



    voice "2RI_0640"
    rin "「因为你连第二性征都还没出现嘛，也没有变声」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_36f08484:



    voice "2HI_0630"
    hina "「以后也不会变声！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_c1837174:



    voice "2RI_0641"
    rin "「啊哈哈哈」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_0ac225ae:



    voice "2HI_0631"
    hina "「好了好了！总之很多女生都送了我巧克力！怎么样，羡不羡慕？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_910b0657:


    "阳菜自暴自弃了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_33aca78c:



    voice "2RI_0642B"
    rin "「其实我也收了不少来着～虽然我一直留着长发～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_182c5116:


    "伦像是洗发水广告里的模特一样撩起自己的头发。行为欠揍但模样确实秀色可餐。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_c7104257:



    voice "2HI_0632"
    hina "「……收了多少？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_5493eff2:



    voice "2RI_0643"
    rin "「往年都是四五十个左右吧。还不至于开卡车来运走」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_ff56d7f0:



    voice "2MI_0529"
    miyako "「哦～～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_db4a0362:



    voice "2RI_0644"
    rin "「唉，谁让我这么抢手呢～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_ea6ebbc8:


    "毕竟光从外表判断这家伙还是很不错的。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_40bdf09e:



    voice "2HI_0633"
    hina "「唔唔唔唔唔唔唔」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_5048cc68:


    "阳菜的表情越来越难看了。太好懂了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_dd82a0ea:



    voice "2RI_0645"
    rin "「你可别吃醋哦～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_7963c03e:



    voice "2HI_0634"
    hina "「我才……没有吃醋」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_db8292f3:



    voice "2RI_0646"
    rin "「比起无人问津的恋人，还是人见人爱的恋人更好吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_30330261:



    voice "2HI_0635"
    hina "「………………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_ef07b3a2:



    voice "2MI_0530"
    miyako "「收下这么多巧克力，会吃撑吧！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_43b5c32a:


    "这位同学感慨的点也很奇怪。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_68883f33:



    voice "2HI_0636"
    hina "「今、今年就由我来送巧克力——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_44a0340d:



    voice "2RI_0647"
    rin "「其实我不太喜欢甜食，所以是担心吃撑之前的问题了～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_f7d2fc7d:


    "没等伦听见，阳菜到嘴边的话就没了去处。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_a4484c9b:



    voice "2FU_0529"
    fumi "「抱歉，我来迟了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_0f7c27b4:



    voice "2RI_0648"
    rin "「啊，辛苦了～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_1339e852:


    "刚回来的文面带歉意。伦上前迎接。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_331cb482:



    voice "2HI_0637"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_444e0653:


    "阳菜未能传达的心意也因此动摇。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_3c6fbf13:



    voice "2MI_0531"
    miyako "「没关系」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_adbaddcd:


    "圣夜子轻轻顺了顺她的背。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_3dd0eeec:



    voice "2HI_0638"
    hina "「嗯，谢谢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_c9a14506:


    "阳菜冲圣夜子微笑道。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_5b70bbd3:



    voice "2RI_0649"
    rin "「好嘞。人都来齐了我们回去吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_37481bf9:



    voice "2HI_0639"
    hina "「嗯！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_55e3f718:


    "阳菜拿起书包，跑了上去。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_0fd4d656:


    "…………"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou2_01_c4393766:


    "嗯，你也是个十足的女孩子哦。"
